# Counter-example: split it, but commit the changelog first.
#
# Two commits, identical final tree, and the first commit announces a fix that
# is not in the repository yet. Anyone bisecting or cherry-picking the fix gets
# a commit that only edits markdown.

git reset HEAD~1
git add CHANGELOG.md
git commit -m "Start a changelog"
git add convert.py
git commit -m "Fix the sign of the timezone offset"
git log --oneline
